  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760438,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## Jack Nicklaus Presents the Major Championship Courses of 1989 (Commodore 64)\n\nStep onto the virtual fairways and experience the thrill of championship golf with *Jack Nicklaus Presents the Major Championship Courses of 1989* for the Commodore 64! This add-on disk expands upon the already impressive *Jack Nicklaus' Greatest 18 Holes of Major Championship Golf* and *Jack Nicklaus' Unlimited Golf & Course Design*, bringing three iconic courses to life.\n\nChallenge yourself at Oak Hill Country Club, host of the 1989 U.S. Open, navigate the challenging links of Royal Troon Golf Club (1989 Open Championship), and test your skills at the prestigious Kemper Lakes Golf Club (1989 PGA Championship).  Each course is meticulously recreated, offering a realistic and demanding golfing experience. \n\nFeaturing classic Jack Nicklaus gameplay, players can choose from various skill levels and compete against the computer or a friend in split-screen multiplayer.  Experience the pressure of major championship golf, right in your living room! This disk is compatible with both *Greatest 18 Holes* and *Unlimited Golf*, offering expanded content and replayability."
    },
